1. Commit / push / merge LOI-relevant work (persist, USB BOT/xHCI, PERC, TLS, auth, console, SKU honesty).
2. Close or open an M8 marker (`RAYNU-V-M8-DISK-PERSIST-OK`, `RAYNU-V-M8-PERC-LUN-OK`, TLS).
